# Paths no deployment is built from. git does not track them, so a Git
# deployment never sees them; this keeps a CLI deployment (`vercel deploy`)
# from uploading them and `vercel dev` (scripts/run-cloud.mjs) from watching
# them: the desktop app's worktrees are whole checkouts, the rest caches and
# local state. Vercel ignores node_modules on its own.
.claude
.go
.turbo
.moon/cache
.zitadel
tmp
